OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome clear spells and light winds
OL,7,Fallowing a touch of frost in places.
OL,8,FMist and fog forming overnight,
OL,9,Fespecially Central Belt and Borders,
OL,10,Fwith a risk of freezing fog in places.
OL,11,FCloudier around the east coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FAny overnight fog may be
OL,14,Fquite slow to clear. Otherwise dry
OL,15,Fwith bright or sunny spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping. Chance of some frost and
OL,17,Ffog developing again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
