OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FTurning chillier but staying dry and
OL,7,Fsunny on Wednesday and Thursday.
OL,8,FOvernight frost and fog possible under
OL,9,Fclearer skies. Milder with bright
OL,10,Fspells Friday, the odd shower in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
